  "releaseNotes": "- Added generic registration support for additional WCF publish information services.\n\t\t  - Added operation-scoped WCF channels with shared `ChannelFactory` reuse, per-operation timeouts, and ownership-aware disposal.\n\t\t  - Migrated `MVCCore` WCF calls to operation-scoped channels while preserving the legacy fallback.\n\t\t  - Added `RSWebContextHelper` and improved WCF header behavior registration.\n\t\t  - Added `EXPECT100_CONTINUE` and additional publish service timeout configuration support.\n\t\t  - Improved culture-aware cent conversion and generic value parsing in `RSModule`, and added the `IsActive` MVC helper.\n\t\t  - Updated FirebaseAdmin, iText, Microsoft.Identity.Client, StackExchange.Redis, and NUglify packages.\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
